WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.100
From the Host List, open the three-dot menu.

2
00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:10.413
Choose Profiles. Profiles let you reuse terminal appearance settings across hosts.

3
00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:17.833
Tap the plus button and name the new profile something memorable. I&#x27;ll use &#x27;Readable&#x27; in this example.

4
00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:27.553
Under Color Scheme, select Solarized Dark. Terminal colors are independent of the app&#x27;s light or dark theme.

5
00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:32.327
Set Font Size to a font size that is comfortable on your screen.

6
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:35.827
Tap Save, then return to the Host List.

7
00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:44.587
Edit the host you want to customize, choose Readable under Profile, and save the host.

8
00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:53.853
The next session for the host will use the colors and font size you chose.
